  "source": "tests/e2e-agent/knowledge/cases/medium/M4-rag-retrieval.yaml",
  "steps": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "yaml": {
        "do": "click",
        "by": {
          "aria-i18n": "knowledge.tabs.rag_config"
        }
      },
      "label": "open RAG config panel",
      "ok": true,
      "resolved": {
        "selector": "[role=\"dialog\"]:has-text(\"RAG 配置\")",
        "found": true,
        "tag": "ASIDE",
        "role": "dialog",
        "ariaLabel": null,
        "dataSlot": "page-side-panel",
        "testid": null,
        "dataStatus": null,
        "text": "RAG 配置\n文档处理\n未设置\n智能分段\n分隔符\n分段大小\ntokens\n重叠大小\ntokens\n\n分块设置的修改只针对新添加的内容有效\n\n嵌入模型\nqwen/qwen3-embedding-0.6b\n请求文档片段数 (Top K)\n6\n1\n50\n检索模式\n混合检索（推荐）\nHybrid Alpha\n0.5\n0.0\n1"
      }
    },
    {
